  "stem": {
   "en": "To prove P(n) for all natural numbers n by induction, we must show:"
  },
  "options": [
   {
    "en": "P(1) only"
   },
   {
    "en": "P(k) → P(k + 1) only"
   },
   {
    "en": "P(1) is true and P(k) → P(k + 1) for every k ≥ 1"
   },
   {
    "en": "P(n) for n = 1, 2, 3"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 2,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "Both the base case and the inductive step are needed; together they cover every natural number."
  },
  "exams": [
